{"id":"9f386b1f-9826-49c8-acbc-3019cec771d9","createdAt":"2026-10-26T15:03:12.825Z","batchId":"onboarding_claude-haiku-5-5_low","approach":"html","modelId":"claude-haiku-5-5","settings":{"effort":"low"},"presetId":"onboarding","prompt":"A three-step onboarding wizard: account, preferences, done. Show the current step and next/back buttons.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n    <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n      <h1>Set up your account</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Three quick steps and you're ready to go. You can change any of these later in settings.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card stack gap-lg\" id=\"wizard\">\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Progress\">\n        <span class=\"badge\" data-step-badge=\"1\">1. Account</span>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\" data-step-badge=\"2\">2. Preferences</span>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\" data-step-badge=\"3\">3. Done</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"progress\"><div id=\"wizard-progress\" style=\"width:33%\"></div></div>\n\n      <div data-step=\"1\" class=\"stack gap-lg\">\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <h3>Step 1 of 3: Account</h3>\n          <p class=\"muted\">Tell us who will be using this workspace.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"grid cols-2\">\n          <label>Full name\n            <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Ada Lovelace\" required>\n          </label>\n          <label>Work email\n            <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"ada@company.com\" required>\n          </label>\n          <label>Password\n            <input type=\"password\" placeholder=\"At least 8 characters\" required>\n          </label>\n          <label>Company\n            <input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Analytical Engines Ltd\">\n          </label>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"small muted\">We'll send a verification link to your work email.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div data-step=\"2\" class=\"stack gap-lg\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <h3>Step 2 of 3: Preferences</h3>\n          <p class=\"muted\">Choose how the workspace should look and notify you.</p>\n        </div>\n        <label>Time zone\n          <select>\n            <option>(UTC+00:00) London</option>\n            <option selected>(UTC+01:00) Berlin</option>\n            <option>(UTC-05:00) New York</option>\n            <option>(UTC-08:00) Los Angeles</option>\n            <option>(UTC+09:00) Tokyo</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n        <label>Default currency\n          <select>\n            <option selected>EUR</option>\n            <option>USD</option>\n            <option>GBP</option>\n            <option>JPY</option>\n          </select>\n        </label>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <span class=\"small\">Notifications</span>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Weekly summary email</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\"> Product updates and tips</label>\n          <label class=\"check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked> Alerts when a report fails</label>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div data-step=\"3\" class=\"stack gap-lg\" hidden>\n        <div class=\"stack gap-sm\">\n          <h3>Step 3 of 3: Done</h3>\n          <p class=\"muted\">Your workspace is ready. Here is what we saved.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"alert\">\n          <strong>Verification email sent.</strong>\n          <div class=\"small\">Check your inbox to confirm your address. Some features stay locked until you do.</div>\n        </div>\n        <table>\n          <thead><tr><th>Setting</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            <tr><td>Time zone</td><td>(UTC+01:00) Berlin</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Default currency</td><td>EUR</td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Weekly summary email</td><td><span class=\"badge\">On</span></td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Product updates</td><td><span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Off</span></td></tr>\n            <tr><td>Failed report alerts</td><td><span class=\"badge\">On</span></td></tr>\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"hr\"></div>\n      <div class=\"between\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-ghost\" id=\"back-btn\" type=\"button\" disabled>Back</button>\n        <button class=\"btn\" id=\"next-btn\" type=\"button\">Next</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var current = 1, total = 3;\n  var next = document.getElementById('next-btn');\n  var back = document.getElementById('back-btn');\n  var bar = document.getElementById('wizard-progress');\n\n  function render() {\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-step]').forEach(function (el) {\n      el.hidden = Number(el.getAttribute('data-step')) !== current;\n    });\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-step-badge]').forEach(function (el) {\n      var n = Number(el.getAttribute('data-step-badge'));\n      el.className = n === current ? 'badge' : 'badge badge-outline';\n    });\n    bar.style.width = (current / total * 100) + '%';\n    back.disabled = current === 1;\n    next.textContent = current === total ? 'Finish' : (current === total - 1 ? 'Finish setup' : 'Next');\n    if (current === total) { next.textContent = 'Go to dashboard'; }\n  }\n\n  next.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    if (current < total) { current++; render(); }\n    else { next.disabled = true; next.textContent = 'Redirecting…'; }\n  });\n  back.addEventListener('click', function () {\n    if (current > 1) { current--; render(); }\n  });\n  render();\n})();\n</script>","deltas":[[999,"<div class=\"page"],[1018,"\">\n  <div class=\"st"],[1141,"ack g"],[1141,"ap-lg\">\n    <"],[1141,"div class=\"stack gap-"],[1141,"sm\">\n      <h1"],[1141,">Set"],[1141," up your account</h1>"],[1164,"\n      <p class=\"lead\">"],[1183,"Three"],[1200," qu"],[1218,"ick steps and"],[1239," you're"],[1259," ready to go"],[1280,". You"],[1297," can change any"],[1317," of these later"],[1337," in"],[1357," settings.</p>\n    "],[1379,"</div>\n\n    <div class"],[1400,"=\"card"],[1419," st"],[1442,"ack gap-l"],[1459,"g\""],[1482," id=\"wizard\">"],[1502,"\n      <div class=\"row g"],[1522,"ap-sm\""],[1542," role"],[1564,"=\"list\" aria-label=\""],[1586,"Progress\">\n        <span"],[1603," class=\"badge\" data"],[1626,"-step-"],[1644,"bad"],[1665,"ge=\"1\">1"],[1685,". Account</span>\n        "],[1708,"<span class=\"badge bad"],[1727,"ge-out"],[1751,"line\" data-step-badge"],[1768,"=\"2\">2. Prefer"],[1789,"ences</span>\n        <span"],[1809," class=\"badge badge-out"],[1830,"line\" data-step-badge"],[1850,"=\"3\">3. Done</"],[1872,"span>\n      </div>"],[1892,"\n      <div class=\"progress\""],[1912,"><div id"],[1931,"=\"w"],[1952,"izard-progress\" style=\""],[1974,"width:33%\"></div></"],[1994,"div>\n\n      <div data"],[2014,"-step=\"1\" class"],[2040,"=\"stack gap-l"],[2057,"g\">\n        <div"],[2076," class=\"stack g"],[2097,"ap-sm\">\n          <"],[2119,"h3"],[2138,">Step 1 of "],[2157,"3: Account"],[2178,"</h3>\n          <p"],[2197," class=\"mu"],[2218,"ted\">T"],[2239,"ell us who will"],[2260," be"],[2279," using this"],[2301," workspace.</p>"],[2320,"\n        </div>\n        <div"],[2341," class=\"grid c"],[2365,"ols-2\">\n          <label"],[2381,">"],[2418,"Full name"],[2428,"\n            <input type=\"text\" plac"],[2448,"eholder=\"Ada"],[2479," Lovelace\""],[2484," required>\n          </la